<Base title="Enquire · Cakeopedia Austin" description="How to ask Cakeopedia Austin about a celebration cake." current="/enquiry/">
  <div class="wrap page-head prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Enquire</p>
    <h1>Online enquiries are opening soon</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:var(--space-3)">The short enquiry form is not live yet, so nothing typed on this site is sent anywhere. Please message Cakeopedia on Instagram for now.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="https://www.instagram.com/cakeopedia.austin/" rel="noopener">Message on Instagram</a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/creations/">Keep browsing</a></div>
    <h2>When it opens</h2>
    <p>The form will ask for your occasion, date, size and flavour ideas, and let you add up to three pictures from anywhere to show your vision. An enquiry is a request, not an order: the final design and price are agreed with you.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
